<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1CO" style="id">1MKLNT-OMU SEBEZI NO KUTOLOKA EBIBELE NO SILUYANA</book>
  <para style="h">1 MAKOLINTE</para>
  <para style="toc1">Eliñolo no matatekelo lya Paulusi ku Makolinte</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Makolinte</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Mak</para>
  <para style="mt2">Elin̄olo lya Paulusi no weli ku</para>
  <para style="mt1">MAKOLINTE</para>
  <para style="imt">Okulimukisa</para>
  <para style="ip">Elin̄olo no weli no Makolinte kame lina kun̄oliwa kwa mutumiwa Paulusi mu myaka no makumi mutanu ni mutanu (55) munyima no kuleiwa kwa Kilesite (1.1). Eli lyokame elin̄olo no weli ku man̄olo ayiili awo ana kun̄ola Paulusi mu Kolinte. Kame ana kun̄ola elin̄olo eli mu nako eyo yoli mu Efese oweli yo yambuta okuta ku Kolinte okutunda ku Mesidoniya (16.9).</para>
  <para style="ip">Elin̄olo eli neli ekalabo ku man̄usa awo ana kutambula Paulusi okutunda kwaanu no keleke mulibaka no mikwa no kupula mu keleke, bamweya nuukutaba ni uhule. Omulenen̄i no Kolinte nau kulimukiwa ku uhule wawo mi ka inu ikomokisa eyo ekeleke aba ina kumona etitaba eti. Makolinte no weli kame likwite ekauhanyo eyo ilimukiwa onene no lilato (13).</para>
  <para style="iot">Emitwi no titaba</para>
  <para style="io">Paulusi kame akeeta Amakolinte nuukutumela kwa Nyambe mulibaka lyoo (1.1-9).</para>
  <para style="io">Cwale Paulusi kame ambola etitaba eto ana kutambula mulibaka no oukutaba mu keleke no Makolinte (1.10-21).</para>
  <para style="io">Esi sitatamako Paulusi kame ambola etitaba no uhule nuukutwala ku kuta omunjili ni munjili (5-6).</para>
  <para style="io">Munyima no eyo kame aba etitaelo ba titaba no makwala, eitabelo no kutendela emilimu, okulapela patalaza, etimpo no mebo mane ni kwinguka (7-15).</para>
  <para style="io">Kumamaneneno kame amana okwamba ba inu itendahala ni titaba no munu yomboci (16).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1CO 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 1:1"/>Okutunda kwa mene Paulusi, ona isaniwa muku singa kwa Nyambe oku tenda omutumiwa wa Jesu Kilesite ni Sositeni omwabetu,<verse eid="1CO 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 1:2"/>Kame ni n̄olela ku keleke ya Nyambe eyo ili mu Kolinte, naawo akenisitwe mwa Kilesite Jesu aa ana isanwa nji atende ano kupumena bamweya naawo ali mu sibaka sonje awo aisana ba litina lya Molyetu Jesu Kilesite, Omolyoo bamweya naaci.<verse eid="1CO 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 1:3"/>Esishemo ni kozo ikale naanyi okutunda kwa Nyambe sitetu, ni kwa molyetu Jesu Kilesite.<verse eid="1CO 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Etimbuyoti mwa Kilesite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 1:4"/>Kame niku tumela kwa Nyambe enako yonje mulibaka lyenu, mu sishemo sa Nyambe muna biwi mwa Jesu Kilesite <verse eid="1CO 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 1:5"/>nji mundila yonje kame muna fumisiwa mwa yonyene mu kwamba konje mane ni mu zibo yonje <verse eid="1CO 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 1:6"/>simba oupaki wa Kilesite kame ongotitwe mukaci kenu <verse eid="1CO 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 1:7"/>mulibakeelyo kakwisa eso muulwile mu mpo yonje no mebo kanyi omo munyolelele okutatelela okumonahala kwa Mbumu Jesu Kilesite. <verse eid="1CO 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 1:8"/>Yoso myongota okutwala ku mamaneneno, nji muulwe esi si nyazahala mu liywaa lya Mbumu Jesu Kilesite. <verse eid="1CO 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 1:9"/>Nyambe wa kusepahala, yonyene ona mi isanene okwingena mu ukuwana ni mwanaye Jesu Kilesite Ombum wetu.<verse eid="1CO 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Oukutaba mu Keleke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 1:10"/>Abaange kame nimi kumbela, mu litina lya molyetu Jesu Kilesite nji moonje, mukuyupe nji cwale oukutaba kulese okwikalako mukaci kenu, kono mu kuwane wino mu maikuto amweya mane nimu munahano umweya. <verse eid="1CO 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 1:11"/>Kakuli kame nina biheliwa kwaanu a Kiloe nji oukulwisa kame kuli mukaci kenu anyi abaange. <verse eid="1CO 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 1:12"/>Eso nitalusa neesi, omunu yonje kwaanyi kame aamba nji, “Mene kame nili wa Paulusi”, Simba nji, “Mene kame nili wa Apolosi”, Simba nji, “Mene kame nili wa Kefasi”, Simba nji, “Mene kame nili wa Kilesite”. <verse eid="1CO 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 1:13"/>Ninji Kilesite kame aku tabile? Paulusi kame ana kungongotelwa ba sifapno mulibaka lyenu? Nji kame muna kolobezwa mu litina lya Paulusi?<verse eid="1CO 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 1:14"/>Kame niku tumela aba kanisi kolobeza omunu kwaanyi, konji feela Kilisipasi ni Gayusi. <verse eid="1CO 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 1:15"/>Nji cwale kuulwe omunu so aamba nji kame muna kukolobeziwa mu litina lyange. <verse eid="1CO 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 1:16"/>Kame ni na kolobeze asindoo ya Setefanasi, okutunda abo kaniyii nji kame nina kolobeze kame omunu. <verse eid="1CO 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 1:17"/>Kakuli Kilesite kasini tuma nji ni kolobeze, kono nji naambe eliywi no kuwaba, kono kasa mu kushangama no maywi nji esifapahano sa Kilesite siulwe okufutuka esi nambulwa tuso.<verse eid="1CO 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kilesite Amaata ni Kushangama kwa Nyambe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 1:18"/>Kakuli etuto no sifapano weelo kwaa afa, kono kwaaci awo ayoyisitwe yonyene ni maata a Nyambe. <verse eid="1CO 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 1:19"/>Kakuli kame kun̄olilwe nji, “Kame sani sinye okushangama nwawo asi kushangama, ezibo nwawo ashangamine ni ifutule esinu no mbango.” <verse eid="1CO 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 1:20"/>Okwaali omunu no kushangama? Omun̄oli kubine ali? Ositin̄ananyi no tinako no bano okwaali? Kana Nyambe kasifutula okushangama no litunga okuutenda oweelo? <verse eid="1CO 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 1:21"/>Kakuli cwalehe mu kushangama kwa Nyambe elitunga kalisiku limuka Nyambe okubitela mu kushangama kwalyo. Kame si wabelisa Nyambe mu weelo tuna kwiyete okuyoyisa awo apumena. <verse eid="1CO 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 1:22"/>Kakuli aendisi no Majuda kame a kumbela emakazo, mi Amagelike kame asaela okushangama. <verse eid="1CO 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 1:23"/>Kono aci kame tukutaza nji Kilesite nakungongotelwa ba sifapano, oko kutendile esi sisataliso ku Majuda, weelo kwa asimacaba, <verse eid="1CO 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 1:24"/>kono kwawo ana isanwa, onje Amajuda ni Magelike, Kilesite yo maata a Nyambe ni kushangama kwa Nyambe. <verse eid="1CO 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 1:25"/>Kakuli oweelo wa Nyambe niwa kushangama onene okubita aanu, mi oufokoli wa Nyambe kame kuli ni maata okubita no aanu.<verse eid="1CO 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 1:26"/>Abaange, mu tokomele okwisanwa kwenu, kakwisa ano kupula kwaanyi awo ashangamine okukumanena ni moyo no litunga, kakwisa ano kupula awo ali ni maata, kakwisa ano kupula ana leiwa mu lusika no utokwa. <verse eid="1CO 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 1:27"/>Kono Nyambe na kuketa eyi no weelo mu litunga okwenisa eyo no kushangama, Nyambe na kete eyi nokufokola mu litunga okwenisa eyi no kongola. <verse eid="1CO 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 1:28"/>Nyambe na kuketa eyi ili munji ni kuyenisa mu litunga simba einu eyo yulwileko okwitenda eyi iliko. <verse eid="1CO 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 1:29"/>Nji cwale kuulwe omunu sokuyeema balubala lwa Nyambe. <verse eid="1CO 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 1:30"/>Yokame amatatekelo no moyo wenu mwa Kilesite Jesu, woyo anatende Nyambe okushangama kwetu, ni ku luka kwetu, ni ku kenisiwa kwetu, ni ku liululwa kwetu. <verse eid="1CO 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 1:31"/>Cwalehe kanyi omo ku n̄olelwe nji, “Mulesele woyo oku kuhumusa, aku kuhumusete kwa Mbumu.”<verse eid="1CO 1:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1CO 2"/>
  <para style="s">Elin̄usa okukumanena ni ku Ngongoteliwa kwa Kilesite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 2:1"/>Abaange, aba ina kwiiya kwaanyi, kani siiya nji ni kutaze kwaanyi oupaki wa Nyambe mu maywi no kuneneba simba okushangama. <verse eid="1CO 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 2:2"/>Kakuli kame ina yambuta okwalimuka esinjili mwaanyi konji Jesu Kilesite mi yonyene ona ngongotelwa ba sifapano. <verse eid="1CO 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 2:3"/>Mi kame ina kwikala naanyi mu kufokola nimu kucila onene ni ku njanjata, <verse eid="1CO 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 2:4"/>mi omwambelo wange ni lin̄usa lyange kasa mu ku mikolwisa ni maywi no kushangama, kono neli muku monahalisa no Mebo nesi no maata. <verse eid="1CO 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 2:5"/>Nji cwale etumelo yenu ilese oku pumula ba kushangama nwaanu kono mu maata a Nyambe.<verse eid="1CO 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Okushangama kwa Nyambe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 2:6"/>Nabakulingeso mukaci kawo no ku kula mu Mebo kame twamba mu kushangama, simba nji kasa okushangama no litunga lino, simba no aendisi no litunga lino awo safe. <verse eid="1CO 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 2:7"/>Kono kame twamba etikunutu ni kushangama kwa Nyambe oko kushwekilwe, oko ana sumu Nyambe oweli etinako me katisi kwikalako, nji aci tukanyisiwe. <verse eid="1CO 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 2:8"/>Kakwisa omwendisi simba mumweya ona kuyupisisa esi, kambe kame ana kuyupisisa kambe kasi ku ngongotela Ombumu no kanya. <verse eid="1CO 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 2:9"/>Kono kanyi omo ku n̄olelwe nji, “Kakwisa elitiyo lina imona, simba elitwi lina iyupu, simba omucima no munu ona itambula, eyo ana lukisa Nyambe yaawo aa amusinga.” <verse eid="1CO 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 2:10"/>Nyambe kame ana imonahaza kwaaci mu mebo. Kakuli Emebo eyi saisisa einu yonje, mane neyi itungile ya Nyambe. <verse eid="1CO 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 2:11"/>Kakuli anyine omunu woyo olimuka emihupulo no munu konji emebo no munu eyo ili mwa yonyene. Mumukwanongeso kakwisa woyo olimuka emihupulo ya Nyambe konji Emebo ya Nyambe. <verse eid="1CO 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 2:12"/>Aci katusi tambula emebo no litunga, kono natu tambula Emebo eyi itunda kwa Nyambe nji tu yupisise etimpo ana tubi Nyambe.<verse eid="1CO 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 2:13"/>Mi kame twamba eyi mu maywi no kwaiyetiwa mu kushangama kwa munu, kono okwiyetiwa ku Mebo, okutoloka eniti no Mebo kwawo atwalelela mu Mebo. <verse eid="1CO 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 2:14"/>Omunu ulwile Emebo ka tambula etimpo no Mebo ya Nyambe kakuli kwa yonyene ni weelo, mi ka twese okwiyupisisa kakuli kame ilemuhiwa ni mebo. <verse eid="1CO 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 2:15"/>Kono omunu no Mebo, kame aatula einu yonje, kono yonyene kaatulwa ku munu. <verse eid="1CO 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 2:16"/>Kakuli kanyi aman̄olo aba aamba nji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:16">“Anyine woyo olimukile omuhupulo wa Nyambe?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 2:16">Nji a mulaele?”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1CO 2:16">Kono aci natu limuka omuhupulo wa Kilesite.<verse eid="1CO 2:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1CO 3"/>
  <para style="s">Abika a Nyambe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 3:1"/>Kono abaange, mene kanisi kutwesa okwamba naanyi omu kwiyetelwa aanu no mebo, kono kanyi aanu no unu, kanyi tukeke tucana mwa Kilesite <verse eid="1CO 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 3:2"/>Kame nina milele ni mawe, kasa ni ilya no kongola kakuli kamusi kwi twesa, mane simba abano ka mwitwese, <verse eid="1CO 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 3:3"/>kakuli musi tendile aa ayoya mu unu. Kakuli ba nako ino kame muli ni muna ni tifapano mukaci kenu, kana kamuyoyo kanyi kame muli muunu mane ni mikwa yenu kanyi aanu feela? <verse eid="1CO 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 3:4"/>Kakuli omunjili aba aamba nji, “Mene kame nili wa Paulusi, mi omunjili nji, “Mene kame nili wa Apolosi,” kamutendile aanu feela no litunga?<verse eid="1CO 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 3:5"/>Cwale anyine Apolosi? Ni Paulusi anyine? Abika fela awo muna pumene kwa onyene, kanyi Mbumu omo ana tumene omunjili ni munjili. <verse eid="1CO 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 3:6"/>Mene kame nina kunu, Apolosi kame ana itaele ameyi, kono Nyambe yona kulisa eyo ina kuniwa. <verse eid="1CO 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 3:7"/>Cwale simba woyo okuna simba woyo oitaela kakwite outokwa kono konji feela Nyambe woyo omenisa ni kukulisa. <verse eid="1CO 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 3:8"/>Woyo okuna ni woyo oitaela ameyi ni sinu simweya fela, mi omunjili ni munjili kame satambule omupuzo okukumanena ni musebezi waye ana tende. <verse eid="1CO 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 3:9"/>Kakuli kame tusebeleza Nyambe bamweya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 3:9">Anyi elitema lya Nyambe, anyi endoo ya Nyambe. <verse eid="1CO 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 3:10"/>Okukumanena ku sishemo sa Nyambe eso ana nibi kanyi osiku limuka okuyaka kame nina kumi monisa omutomo kono omunu munjili kame ayakabo. Kono omunu ni munu atokomele omo a yakelabo. <verse eid="1CO 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 3:11"/>Kakuli kakwisa woyo so yaka omutomo mundina, konji owo onayakiwa, yonyene Jesu Kilesite. <verse eid="1CO 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 3:12"/>Nji omunjili kame ayaka ba mutomo owo ni gauda, simba ni silibela, simba ni mawee no utokwa, simba ni itondo, simba ni musuhela no moopu, simba ni mwange, <verse eid="1CO 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 3:13"/>Omusebezi no munu ni munu mba u moniwa. Kakuli Eliywaa mba liumonahalisa kakuli kame sauku monahalise ni mulilo, mi omulilo mba weteke omusebezi no munu ni munu nji ngaibi wikalile owo ana tende. <verse eid="1CO 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 3:14"/>Nji omusebezi no munu yonje owo ana yaka ba mutomo aba so u siyale wo imanine, yonyene mba tambula omupuzo. <verse eid="1CO 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 3:15"/>Nji omusebezi no munu aba ubya, omunu woyo kakwisa eso sa wanebo simba nji yonyene mba yoyisiwa, kanyi woyo ona banduka mu mulilo. <verse eid="1CO 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 3:16"/>Kana ka mulikile nji aanyi Endoo ya Nyambe mane nji ni Mebo ya Nyambe kame iyoya mwaanyi! <verse eid="1CO 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 3:17"/>Nji omunu kame asinya endoo ya Nyambe, Nyambe mba mu sinyi. Kakuli endoo ya Nyambe niya kukena, mi endoo ya Nyambe eyo aanyi mwenyene.<verse eid="1CO 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 3:18"/>Omunu alese okoonga. Nji omunjili mukaci kenu kame anahana nji wa kushangama ba nako ino afutuke omwelo nji cwale akatende woyo no kushangama luli. <verse eid="1CO 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 3:19"/>Kakuli okushangama no litunga lino weelo mu miyo a Nyambe, kakuli kame ku n̄olilwe mu man̄olo nji, “Kame saswase asi kushangama mu tingana too,” <verse eid="1CO 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 3:20"/>mi kame, “Ombumu kame alimukile emihupulo yawo asi kushangama nji kaikwite tuso.” <verse eid="1CO 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 3:21"/>Cwale omunu alese oukuyeema mulibaka nwaanu, Kakuli einu yonje ni yenu, <verse eid="1CO 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 3:22"/>Simba Paulusi, simba Apolosi, simba Kefasi, simba elitunga, simba omoyo, simba elifu, simba eyi iliko, simba eyi isiiya, yonje ni yenu <verse eid="1CO 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 3:23"/>mi anyi kame muli kwa Kilesite, mi Kilesite kame ali kwa Nyambe.<verse eid="1CO 3:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1CO 4"/>
  <para style="s">Atumiwa a Kilesite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 4:1"/>Omo mokufanenena nji omunu atwalikete kanyi abika a Kilesite ni ikombwa no inu ya Nyambe eyi ishwekilwe. <verse eid="1CO 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 4:2"/>Mi cwale esi sisingahala ku ikombwa ninji isepahale. <verse eid="1CO 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 4:3"/>Kono kwa mene ni sinu sinyonyo a basa ni atulwe kwaanyi, simba ni kuta nwaanu mane simba me kani kwatula menyene. <verse eid="1CO 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 4:4"/>Kakuli menyene kani kumono omubonda oli mwa mene mu sinu sinjili, kono cwale kani tendile nji nili woyo no kusepahala luli. Ombumu yoso natula. <verse eid="1CO 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 4:5"/>Cwalehe mulese okwatula enako ekayasikwana kale. Ombumu yo kasiiya kale woyo so lita einu mu liseli eyo ishwekilwe mu uwi ni kushotola emihupulo namu micima. Cwale omunu ni munu bokame abo sa tambule okububekiwa kwaye okutunda kwa Nyambe.<verse eid="1CO 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 4:6"/>Abaange, kame ni talusa eyo yonje mwa mene ni Apolosi mulibaka lyenu, nji mu kwiyete mwaaci kasa okutunda kweyo in̄olilwe nji kulese okwikala omunu kwaanyi woyo soku kuhumuseta omunjili mane ni kulwisa omukwaye. <verse eid="1CO 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 4:7"/>Kakuli anyine woyo omona eshutano mwaanyi? Siikene eso ukwite nji kausi tambula? Nji cwale nusi tambula, cwale ikene aba ukukumusa kanyi kaisi kutenda empo?<verse eid="1CO 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 4:8"/>Kame mukwite einu yonje eyo mu saela? Mwa fuma kale? Me mu lemine oku busa, aci mekatu sako mwatenda kale ambumu. Kambe kame mu busa luli, nji cwale naaci tubuse naanyi. <verse eid="1CO 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 4:9"/>Kakuli kame nimona nji Nyambe na tu beeke nji aaci atumiwa, kwawo no mamaneneno kwaanu onje, kanyi aanu atulelwe elifu, kakuli natu beekiwa okwaliketwa ku litunga, ku mangeloi ni kwaanu. <verse eid="1CO 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 4:10"/>Aci kame tuli aelo mulibaka lya Kilesite, kono anyi kame muli asikushangama mwa Kilesite! Kame tufokola, kono anyi kame muli akoongola! Anyi kame mukutekiwa, kono aci mu kwakutekiwa! <verse eid="1CO 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 4:11"/>Mane simba banako ino kame tufanga elishebo ni linyotwa, mi kame twenda no kwa kumanga wino, kame tutendiwa ouyi, mi katukwite esibaka oko no kwikala, <verse eid="1CO 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 4:12"/>kame tu sebeza onene ni maoko etu. Mi aba tukutiwa kame tu fuyola, aba tu yandisiwa kame tu kongota, <verse eid="1CO 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 4:13"/>naba twangoliwa kame tweteka okuku usa, kame tu tendilwe amanyalala no litunga, mi kame tuli amanyalala no inu yonje.<verse eid="1CO 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 4:14"/>Kani simin̄olela eyi nji mwenisiwe, kono oku milemusa kanyi anange aa nisinga. <verse eid="1CO 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 4:15"/>Kakuli simba nji kame mukwite aiyeti no kupula onene mwa Kilesite, kamu kwite asitenu no kupula. Kakuli kame ninakutenda sitenu mwa Kilesite Jesu mulibaka no liywi no kuwaba. <verse eid="1CO 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 4:16"/>Kame nimi kumbela onene cwale nji mutende afaniketi ange. <verse eid="1CO 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 4:17"/>Cwalehe kame nimitumena Timoteya, mwanange nisinga ni kusepahala mwa Mbumu nji amipulukise emikwa yange mwa Kilesite, kanyi omu nina kwaiyeteta konje mu tikeleke tonje.<verse eid="1CO 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 4:18"/>Anjili kame anoku kumusa kanyi kanisi kwiyanga kwaanyi. <verse eid="1CO 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 4:19"/>Kono mbaniiyi kwanyi muwangu nji Mbumu mba singi, mi mbani saisisa kasa omwambelo nwawo asiku kumusa kono amaata oo. <verse eid="1CO 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 4:20"/>Kakuli omubuso wa Nyambe kau monahala mu maywi, kono mu maata. <verse eid="1CO 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 4:21"/>Sibine eso musinga? Niiye kwaanyi ni lunupa, nji mu lilato ni mebo no musa?<verse eid="1CO 4:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1CO 5"/>
  <para style="s">Ouhule mu Keleke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 5:1"/>Kame kuna bihiwa nji kame kuli ouhule mukaci kenu, mi owo no kwawaniwa simba mukaci no asimacaba kakuli omulume kame alangananga ni inawaye nokwa muleya moywaa sitaye! <verse eid="1CO 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 5:2"/>Mi kame mu ku kumusa? Mi kame mufanena okweena? Mulese woyo ona tende ekezo eyo atundisiwe mukaci kenu. <verse eid="1CO 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 5:3"/>Kakuli simba nji mene sisako mu lutu kame niliko mu mebo, kanyi kame nili kwaanyi, naatula kale etaba eyi <verse eid="1CO 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 5:4"/>mu litina lya Mbumu Jesu ba mulume woyo ona tende esinu eso. Aba mukuwanine, mi emebo yange koili ni maata a Mbumu wetu Jesu, <verse eid="1CO 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 5:5"/>woyo mulume mumube kwa Satani nji olutu lusinyiwe nji mebo yaye mwendi mbaika yoyisiwa mu liywaa lya Mbumu Jesu.<verse eid="1CO 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 5:6"/>Ouku kumusa kwenu kasa wa kuwaba. Ka muyii nji omumena no kucaniba kame ukulisa elin̄ende lyonje? <verse eid="1CO 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 5:7"/>Muku kenise ku mumena no kale nji mu tende elin̄ende no ubya, kanyi aba muulilwe ngeso omumena. Kakuli Kilesite omukoko no Paseka yetu na tendelwe aci esitabelo. <verse eid="1CO 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 5:8"/>Cwalehe mulese aci, tu tende omukiti owo ulwile omumena no kale, omumena no lunya ni kwiiba, kono ni sinkwa na mbulwa omumena eso sikenine mane ni niti.<verse eid="1CO 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 5:9"/>Kame nina kumi n̄olela mu lin̄olo lyange nji mulese oukuwana naanu no mahule. <verse eid="1CO 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 5:10"/>Kasa muku talusa nji mutunde ku mahule onje no litunga lino, simba aanu asi kulakaza oufumu, simba ambuyi, simba asi kulapela emilimu. Kambe kame kuli ngeeso, kambe kame mu fanena okutunda mu litunga. <verse eid="1CO 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 5:11"/>Kono simba nji kame ni min̄olela nji mulese oukuwana ni munu yonje woyo okwisana nji mwabenu yo tendile elihule, simba woyo no kulakaza oufumu, simba osi kulapela emilimu, simba ondalabangwana, simba ombuyi. Mulese okulya naye eilya woyo no ngeso.<verse eid="1CO 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 5:12"/>Kakuli iikene sani tende okwatula awo ali kundee, kasa awo ali mukaci no Keleke awo mufanena okwatula? <verse eid="1CO 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 5:13"/>Nyambe kame atula awo ali kundee. “Mu tundise omunu no kufokola mukaci kenu.”<verse eid="1CO 5:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1CO 6"/>
  <para style="s">Emizeko mukaci no Asikulapela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 6:1"/>Cwale omunjili mwaanyi nji kame ali ni taba ni mukwaye, ka cile okuta ku mulawo balubala no awo no kwakena okubita nji ate kwa aanu no kukena a Nyambe? <verse eid="1CO 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 6:2"/>Kamu limukile nji aanu no kukena a Nyambe mba atula elitunga? Mi nji elitunga kame lyatuliwa kwaanyi, kamu twese okwatula etitaba no kucaniba? <verse eid="1CO 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 6:3"/>Ka muyii nji kame satu atule amangeloi? Ngasibine sakwikalele, cwale onene kweyi no moyo? <verse eid="1CO 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 6:4"/>Cwale nji kame muli ni titaba no ngeso, ikene muku twalela balubala nwawo no kwakutekiwa ku keleke? <verse eid="1CO 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 6:5"/>Kame naamba ngeso nji mweene. Ninji mukaci kenu kakwisa omunu no kushangama otwesa okwamba ba taba ili mukaci no mulapeli ni mwabaye osi kulapela? <verse eid="1CO 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 6:6"/>Kono osikulapela kame azeka ni mwabaye osikulapela, mi kame atenda ngeso balubala nwaanu no kwalapela!<verse eid="1CO 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 6:7"/>Eyi no kukutwala ku kuta kame imonisa nji namu kwangwa. Iikene aba mwatwese oku tambula okufosetwa? Iikene aba mu ulwa oku tambula okongiwa? <verse eid="1CO 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 6:8"/>Kono anyi mwenyene kame mufosa ni kwitela akwenu mane simba abenu luli! <verse eid="1CO 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 6:9"/>Ka muyii nji awo no kwaluka katamba okuyola omubuso wa Nyambe? Mulese okoongiwa, simba ouhule, simba okulapela emilimu, simba okubuka, simba okutendiwa akalombe, <verse eid="1CO 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 6:10"/>simba ambuyi, simba asikuyumena, simba oundalabangwana, simba asimapwa simba katamba okuyola omubuso wa Nyambe. <verse eid="1CO 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 6:11"/>Mi anjili mwaanyi mwa munakwikalela. Kono namu yowisiwa, namu kenisiwa, namu bekiwa asikuluka mu litina lya Jesu Kilesite ni mu Mebo ya Nyambe wetu.<verse eid="1CO 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mukutusise Etinyutu tenu titende Ekanya ya Nyambe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 6:12"/>“Einu yonje nai lumelelwe kwa mene,” Kono kainu yonje eyo itusa. “Einu yonje nai lumelelwe kwa mene,” kono kani tamba okutenda omubika kweyo yonje. <verse eid="1CO 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 6:13"/>“Esilya nisa lipumo, mi elipumo nilya ilya.” Kono Nyambe mba sinyi yonje bamweya. Cwale olutu kalusitendelwa ouhule, kono ni lwa Mbumu mi Ombumu ni wa lutu. <verse eid="1CO 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 6:14"/>Mi Nyambe ona ingula Ombumu mi mba twingula naaci ni maata aye ngeso.<verse eid="1CO 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 6:15"/>Ka muyii nji etinyutu tetu kame tili eilama ya Kilesite? Cwalehe mbanitwese okushimba eilama ya Kilesite okwitenda eilama no lihule? Kokuulwa! <verse eid="1CO 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 6:16"/>Ka muyii nji woyo okuwana ni lihule kame afutuka olutu lumweya ni lyonyene? Kakuli kanyi aba kun̄olilwe nji, “Ayiili mba tende olutu lumweya feela. <verse eid="1CO 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 6:17"/>Kono woyo okuwana ni Mbumu kame afutuka Emebo imweya ni yonyene.<verse eid="1CO 6:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 6:18"/>Mulese okutenda ounyazi, Esibi sonje eso atenda omunu, kame sili kundee no lutu lwaye, kono woyo oyoya mu uhule, kame afoseza olutu lwaye luli. <verse eid="1CO 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 6:19"/>Kamuyii nji olutu lwenu kame lutendile Endoo ya Nyambe no Mebo no kukena eyi ili mwaanyi, eyi mu na biwi kwa Nyambe? Kayenu luli, <verse eid="1CO 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 6:20"/>kakuli namu uliwa ni muulo munene. Abakulingeso, mukanyise Nyambe mu lutu lwenu.<verse eid="1CO 6:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1CO 7"/>
  <para style="s">Etipuzo okukumanena neyi no Makwala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 7:1"/>Cwale okukumanena ni titaba mu nan̄olo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 7:1">Kame kuli wino nji omulume alese okutenda ouhule ni mukati. <verse eid="1CO 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 7:2"/>Kono mulibaka no kucila emiliko no unyazi, omulume yonje kame afanena okwikala ni moywaye, mi omukati yonje aikale ni mbumwaye. <verse eid="1CO 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 7:3"/>Omulume abe moywaye esi sifanena, mi ni yonyene moywaye atende ngeso kwa mbumwaye. <verse eid="1CO 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 7:4"/>Kakuli omukati katwese okubusa olutu lwaye, kono kame ali mu maata a mbumwaye, mu mukwa no ngeso omulume katwese okubusa olutu lwaye, kono kame ali mu maata no moywaye. <verse eid="1CO 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 7:5"/>Mulese oukukana omunjili ku munjili, konji mwendi aba mulumelelana mu libaka linjili nji kame musinga mwenyene okulapela, kono cwale mukuuse bamweya kame nji cwale Satani alese oku myeteka mu kuulwa oukulema kwenu.<verse eid="1CO 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 7:6"/>Kame naamba esi mu kulukuluha, kasa muku milaela. <verse eid="1CO 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 7:7"/>Kame ni singa nji monje kambe kame mufekile mene, kono munu ni munu kame anabiwi empo kwa Nyambe omunjili kame ana biwi esi ni munjili esi.<verse eid="1CO 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 7:8"/>Kwawo no kwakwata simba okukwaliwa mane ni timbakati simba ambalume, kame namba nji kwa kuwaba nji alese okukwata simba okukwaliwa kanyi mene. <verse eid="1CO 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 7:9"/>Kono nji kame akwangwa oukulema akwate. Kakuli ouwa niku kwata kasa okwibaiwa ku titakazo.<verse eid="1CO 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 7:10"/>Kwawo akwatile kame na laela, kasa mene kono Mbumu nji omukati alese oukutaba ni mbumwaye, <verse eid="1CO 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 7:11"/>(kono nji naa kutaba, akwikalele alese oku kwaliwa, mwendi akuuse ni mbumwaye.) Ni yonyene omulume alese okulukulula moywaye.<verse eid="1CO 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 7:12"/>Kwanjili kame naamba, kasa Ombumu, nji osikupumena kwa Nyambe kame ali ni moywaye no kwa pumena kwa Nyambe, mi kame asinga okwikala naye, alese oku mulukulula. <verse eid="1CO 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 7:13"/>Mi omukati aba ali ni mulume no kwa pumena kwa Nyambe mi woyo kame asinga okwikala naye, alese okukana mbumwaye. <verse eid="1CO 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 7:14"/>Kakuli omulume no kwa pumena kwa Nyambe kame akenisiwa mulibaka no moywaye, mi omukati no kwa pumena kwa Nyambe kame akenisiwa kwa mbumwaye. Kambesi ngeso, kambe anenu kame ali ano kwakena, kandi cwale omo kwikalele kame akenine. <verse eid="1CO 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 7:15"/>Kono nji woyo no kwa pumena kwa Nyambe kame asinga nji akutabe, kutendahale ngeso. Mu taba eyo omulume simba omukati ka nungiwa. Kakuli Nyambe kame anatwisanene okuyoya mu kozo. <verse eid="1CO 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 7:16"/>Wene omukati, ngasibine olimukile nji mbu yoyisa mbumowe? Ni wene omulume, ngasibine olimukile nji mbu yoyisa moyowowe?<verse eid="1CO 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Muyoye kanyi omo Munaisanenwe kwa Nyambe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 7:17"/>Cwale mulese omunu yonje ayoye omoyo ana biwi kwa Mbumu nomo ana mwisanene Nyambe, esi sokame ni laela mu tikeleke tonje. <verse eid="1CO 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 7:18"/>Nji omunu na isaniwa yowa ingena kale ku mupato, alesele okutundisa eisupo no mupato, nji omunu na isaniwa yokasi ingena kale ku mupato, alese oka ingenamo mu mupato. <verse eid="1CO 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 7:19"/>Kakuli okwingena simba okwaingena mu mupato kasinu sinjili, kono esi no utokwa okukuteka fela emilawo ya Nyambe. <verse eid="1CO 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 7:20"/>Munu yonje aikale mu moyo ana kwikalelamo enako eyi ana kwisanwa kwa Nyambe. <verse eid="1CO 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 7:21"/>Nji kame ona isanwa wooli omubika? Olese kubilaela, kono aba utwesa oku lukuluha, osebelise ekolo eyo. <verse eid="1CO 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 7:22"/>Kakuli woyo ona kwisaniwa mwa Mbumu yoli omubika, munu wa kulukuluha wa Mbumu. Mu ndila imweya, woyo ona kulukuluha aba ana kwiisaniwa, mubika kwa Kilesite. <verse eid="1CO 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 7:23"/>Kame mu na kuuliwa ni muulo no kuneneba, cwale mu lese oku futuka abika nwaanu. <verse eid="1CO 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 7:24"/>Cwale abaange, munu yonje aikale kwa Nyambe omo ana kwikalelamo mu nako eyo aba ana kwisanwa.<verse eid="1CO 7:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Etipuzo okukumane nawo nokwa kwata ni Timbelwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 7:25"/>Cwale okukumanena nawo no kwa kwalwa ni kukwata, kani kwite etaelo ya Mbumu, kono kame ni lita amaikuto ange, kanyi woyo mu sishemo sa Mbumu kame ni sepahala.<verse eid="1CO 7:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 7:26"/>Cwale kame ni yambuta nji mu nako no tiziyezi, kwa kuwaba omunu okwikala omo aikalele. <verse eid="1CO 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 7:27"/>Nunungiwa ku mukati? Olese oku saela etukuluho. Nulukuluha ku mukati? Olese kukwata. <verse eid="1CO 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 7:28"/>Kono nji kame okwata, kutende esibi, mi omukatana aba akwaliwa katende esibi. Kono awo akwata mbaikala ni mayando no litunga mi mba nimitundisa kweyo.<verse eid="1CO 7:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 7:29"/>Abaange, esi nitalusa neesi, enako niya kwibiba, okutunda bano awo ali na moyoo, atende kanyi kakwatile, <verse eid="1CO 7:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 7:30"/>mi awo alila, atende kanyi kalili, awo awabelelwe, atende kanyi kasi wabelelwa, mi awo aula, atende kanyi kakwite einu ana ulu, <verse eid="1CO 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 7:31"/>awo aku tusisa eyi no litunga lino, atende kanyi kaku tusisa yo, kakuli omukwa no litunga lino kame ubwa.<verse eid="1CO 7:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 7:32"/>Kame nisinga nji muulwe etipilaelo. Omulume no kwakwata kame anyolelwe eyi ya Mbumu omu sa wabelisese Ombumu. <verse eid="1CO 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 7:33"/>Kono omulume no kukwata kame alakaza eyi no ba litunga omo sa wabelisese moywaye, <verse eid="1CO 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 7:34"/>mi etitakazo taye kame tikutabile. Mi omukati mukulu simba omukatana nokwa kwaliwa kame alakaza emisebezi ya Mbumu omo sa kenene mu lutu ni mu mebo, kono omukati no ku kwaliwa kame alakaza eyi no litunga nomo sa wabelisete mbumwaye.<verse eid="1CO 7:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 7:35"/>Kame naamba eyi mulibaka lyenu kasa oku mi kanisa, kono okumi twala kweyi ifanena nji mu sebeleze Mbumu oku ulwile esi si mi tundisa kwa Mbumu.<verse eid="1CO 7:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 7:36"/>Nji omunu kame ayambuta nji katende wino kwawoyo ana beeleze, mi nji etitakazo taye nita koongola mi kame afanena okutenda ngeeso, atende omwa singela akwate, kakwisa sibi. <verse eid="1CO 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 7:37"/>Kono woyo yonje ongolile mu mucima waye, nambulwa eso asaela kono yo kulemine mu titakazo taye ni kuteula eyi ili mu mucima waye mane nikubabalela woyo abeelelize, kame atenda wino. <verse eid="1CO 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 7:38"/>Cwale woyo okwata woyo ana beeleze kame atenda wino, mi woyo oulwa oku kwata, kame atenda wino mane ni ku bitelela.<verse eid="1CO 7:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 7:39"/>Omukati kame anungilwe kwa mbumwaye yo siyoya, nji mbumwaye nafu, omukati kame alukuluhile okukwaliwa kwa woyo yonje asinga, kono konji kwa woyo opumena mwa Mbumu. <verse eid="1CO 7:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 7:40"/>Kono mu katulo yange, kwakuwaba nji omukati akwikalele fela kanyi omo ana kwikalela. Mi kame ni yambuta nji kame nili ni Mebo ya Nyambe.<verse eid="1CO 7:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1CO 8"/>
  <para style="s">Epuzo okukumanena ni Ilya Ibiwangwa ku Milimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 8:1"/>Cwale okukumanena ni ilya ibiwangwa ku milimu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 8:1">Kame tu yii nji “tonje kame tuli ni zibo.” Ezibo kame ilita okukumusa, kono elilato kame li yakisa. <verse eid="1CO 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 8:2"/>Nji omunu kame ayambuta nji kame alimukile esinjili, kasi limuka kale kanyi omo afanenena oku limukela. <verse eid="1CO 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 8:3"/>Kono nji omunu kame asinga Nyambe, woyo kame alimukiwa kwa Nyambe.<verse eid="1CO 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 8:4"/>Cwale kweyi no kulya eyi ibiwa emilimu, kame tuyii nji emilimu kaisako, mi cwale kakwisa Nyambe mundina kono mumweya feela. <verse eid="1CO 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 8:5"/>Kakuli, naaba kuli aa aisaniwa nji “milimu”, mu wilu simba ba litunga, kanyi omo kwikalele luli ya kupula “emilimu” na “mbumu” akupula, <verse eid="1CO 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 8:6"/>cwale kwaaci kame kuli Nyambe mumweya, Sitetu, woyo einu yonje kame itunda kwa yonyene, naaci kame tuli kwa yonyene mi kame kuli ni Mbumu mumweya feela, yonyene Jesu Kilesite woyo einu yonje kame itendilwe mwa yonyene, naaci kame toyoya mulibaka lyaye.<verse eid="1CO 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 8:7"/>Abakulingeso, kasa anu onje aa alimuka ngeso. Kono anjili aa atwaele esizo no milimu, kame alya eilya kanyi kame itendelwe emilimu, mi elizwalo lyoo lya kufokola, mane kame lisilafalile. <verse eid="1CO 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 8:8"/>Esilya kasi tuliti kwa Nyambe. Katu sinyehelwa esinjili naba katuli mi katuekeleziwa esinjili naba tulya esilya.<verse eid="1CO 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 8:9"/>Kono mu tokomele nji oku lukuluha kwenu ku lese oku futuka esi sisataliso kwawo afokola. <verse eid="1CO 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 8:10"/>Kakuli nji omunjili kame amona nji wene kame oli ni zibo, kame wikalile ba tafule mu keleke no milimu, katamba oku susuweziwa nji elizwalo lyaye lya kufokola okulya esilya sina beekelwa emilimu? <verse eid="1CO 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 8:11"/>Mi cwale mulibaka no zibo yowe woyo munu no kufokola kame asinyeha omwabowe woyo ona feliwa kwa Kilesite. <verse eid="1CO 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 8:12"/>Cwale aba mu foseza abeenu ngeso ni kulemeka amazwalo oo aba afokola, abo kame mu foseza Kilesite. <verse eid="1CO 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 8:13"/>Cwalehe, nji esilya kame si kwisa omwabange, ka ni tamba okulya enyama nji ni lese oku sitatalisa omwabange.<verse eid="1CO 8:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1CO 9"/>
  <para style="s">Etitukelo ni Misebezi no Mutumiwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 9:1"/>Ka nisi lukuluha? Ka nili omutumiwa? Kani simona Jesu Ombumu wetu? Kasaanyi embuya no musebezi wange mwa Mbumu? <verse eid="1CO 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 9:2"/>Nji kwanjili kanili omutumiwa, kwaanyi kame nili omutumiwa! Kakuli anyi eliswayo no utumiwa wange mwa Mbumu. <verse eid="1CO 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 9:3"/>Esi sokame esi silelezo sange kwawo ani ibanguta. <verse eid="1CO 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 9:4"/>Kandi katukwite etukelo ku silya ni nwa? <verse eid="1CO 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 9:5"/>Kandi katukwite etukelo no kwenda ni moywetu kanyi anjili atumiwa na inaye Mbumu ni Kefasi? <verse eid="1CO 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 9:6"/>Kasa Banabasi fela ni mene awo kakwite etukelo no kutunda mu kusebeleza okuyoya? <verse eid="1CO 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 9:7"/>Anyine woyo osebeza kanyi musole mi kame akuteneka yonyene? Anyine woyo okuna esitondo no beine yokali kumbuya yaso? Anyine olisa omutapi no mikoko yokali ku mawe no mutapi?<verse eid="1CO 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 9:8"/>Kana kame naamba esi mu maata no unu? Kasanji omulawo wa Mushe kame wamba esinu noukufeka? <verse eid="1CO 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 9:9"/>Kakuli mu mulawo wa Mushe kame kun̄olilwe nji, “Olese oku tika akanwa no pulu aba ilya oubeke.” Ninji Nyambe kame ababalela amapulu feela? <verse eid="1CO 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 9:10"/>Kasa nji kame aamba ngeso mu libaka lyetu? Naiku n̄oliwa mulibaka lyetu kakuli woyo olima kame a fanena oku lima mu sepo, mi woyo okutula oubeke akutule mu sepo no kuwana ekalulo mu kutulo. <verse eid="1CO 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 9:11"/>Nji na tumikunene embuto no kuwaba no mebo mukaci kenu, kana ni sinu sinene aba tu kutula ku inu yenu muna sebeze? <verse eid="1CO 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 9:12"/>Nji anjili kame akutabela etukelo eyi beulu yenu, kasa nji etukelo yetu ya kuneneba?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 9:12">Nabakulingeso ka tusiku kutusisa etukelo eyo, kono kame tuna kongota mu inu yonje, nji tulese oku tikela eliywi lya Kilesite. <verse eid="1CO 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 9:13"/>Ka muyii nji awo anabekiwa okusebeza mu Ndoo ya Nyambe kame awana esilya okutunda ku Ndoo ya Nyambe, mi awo asebeza ba aletale kame atabelwa ku tinubu eto tilitiwa ba aletale? <verse eid="1CO 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 9:14"/>Mu ndila imweya Ombumu na laele nji awo aamba eliywi kame afanena okuyoyela ba liywi.<verse eid="1CO 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 9:15"/>Kono kani siku kutusisa ku tinjili no titukelo eti, simba kame nin̄ola eyi nji ni bukeleze etitukelo eti. Kakuli kame ni fanena okufa kubita okwikala ni munu woyo onilunisa neso nikukumusa naso. <verse eid="1CO 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 9:16"/>Kakuli nji kame ni kutaza eliywi ka kwisa elibaka elyo ni kukumusa nalyo. Kakuli etukelo kame ina bekiwa beulu yange. Oumai kame uli kwa mene nji niulwe okukutaza eliywi! <verse eid="1CO 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 9:17"/>Kakuli nji kame ni tenda mu kusinga kwange, kame nikwite omupuzo kono nji kasa mu kusinga kwange, kame ina biwi omusebezi. <verse eid="1CO 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 9:18"/>Ubine cwale omupuzo wange? Ni wa nji mu kukutaza kame nikutaza eliywi no kuwaba okulwile oku wanamo esinjili, ni lese oku tusisa etukelo yange mu liywi no kuwaba. <verse eid="1CO 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 9:19"/>Kakuli simba nji kame ni lukuluhile kwaanu onje kame ni ku tendile omubika kwaanu onje nji ni luwe aanu no kupula. <verse eid="1CO 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 9:20"/>Ku Majuda kame ni ku tendile kanyi Mujuda, nji ni luwe Amajuda, kwawo ali munji no mulawo wa Mushe kame ni ku tendile kanyi kame nili munji no mulawo, simba nji kanili munji no mulawo nji ni luwe awo ali munji no mulawo. <verse eid="1CO 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 9:21"/>Kwawo ali kundee no mulawo kame ni ku tendile kanyi kame nili kundee no mulawo kasa nji kani kwite omulawo kwa Nyambe kono munji no mulawo wa Kilesite nji ni luwe awo ali kundee no mulawo. <verse eid="1CO 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 9:22"/>Kwawo no kufokola kame niku tendile kanyi kame nifokolile, nji ni luwe awo afokolile mu mebo. Kwanu onje kame ni ku tendile einu yonje, nji ni yoyise anjili. <verse eid="1CO 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 9:23"/>Kame ni tenda einu yonje mulibaka no liywi no kuwaba, nji ni tabelwe ku timbuyoti talyo. <verse eid="1CO 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 9:24"/>Kamuyii nji awo ali mu takano onje awo kame aituka, kono konji mumweya so tambula omupuzo. Cwale mwituke nji muwane omupuzo. <verse eid="1CO 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 9:25"/>Omunu yonje woyo oli mu takano kame akutukiseta mu inu yonje, kame atenda ngeso nji atambule omushukwe owo ubwa, kono aci mba tutambula owo uta oku no kwaabwa. <verse eid="1CO 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 9:26"/>Abakulingeso kani ituka feela, kanilwi kanyi omunu ufula mu mebo. <verse eid="1CO 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 9:27"/>Kono kame nikoongota olutu lwange mu ukulema ni kulutenda omubika wange nji munyima no kukutaza kwanjili nji nilese okakaniwa.<verse eid="1CO 9:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1CO 10"/>
  <para style="s">Emamela mulibaka no kulapela emilimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 10:1"/>Abaange, kame ni singa nji anyi mulimuke nji anjekulyetu onje kame ana kwikala munji no likumbi, mi onje kame ana kuluta eliwate. <verse eid="1CO 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 10:2"/>Mi onje kame ana ku kolobeziwa mwa Mushe mu likumbi ni mu liwate. <verse eid="1CO 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 10:3"/>Onje kame anakulya esilya simweya no mebo <verse eid="1CO 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 10:4"/>mi onje kame ana kunwa ameyi amweya no mebo kakuli kame ana kunwa ku meyi awo atunda ku liwee no mebo elyo lina kwakon̄a mi Eliwee elyo neli Kilesite. <verse eid="1CO 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 10:5"/>Simba kulingeso Nyambe kasi kuwabeliswa kwaanu onje, kakuli kame ana kufela mu lihalaupa.<verse eid="1CO 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 10:6"/>Cwale einu eyi kame itendile etitemuso kwaaci, nji tulese kulakaza eyi no kwiiba, kanyi omo ana ku tendela. <verse eid="1CO 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 10:7"/>Mu lese kufutuka awo alapela emilimu no ifekiso kanyi anjili kwa onyene kanyi omu ku n̄olelwe nji, “Aanu kame aikala banji okulya ni kunwa ni kwimana okunenga.” <verse eid="1CO 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 10:8"/>Tulese okutenda ounyazi, kanyi anjili omo ana kutendela mi aanu no kukwana eikiti makumi ayiili naanu aatu (23;000) mi nakufa mu liywaa limweya. <verse eid="1CO 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 10:9"/>Tulese okweteka Ombumu kanyi anjili omo ana kutendela, mi kame ana kuumiwa ku tinyoka nikufa. <verse eid="1CO 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 10:10"/>Tulese okutongoka, kanyi omu ana kutongookela anjili kwa onyene, mi kame ana ku sinyiwa kwa woyo osikusinya.<verse eid="1CO 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 10:11"/>Cwale einu eyi kame inakutendahala kwa onyene kanyi etemuso, kono kame ina kun̄oliwa mulibaka no kutusimweta beulu ya woyo amamaneneno no tinako na keela. <verse eid="1CO 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 10:12"/>Cwalehe mulesele omunu yonje woyo onahana nji naimana mukoongola alese okukwa. <verse eid="1CO 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 10:13"/>Kakwisa omuliko oneyi kwaanyi owo ulwile outokwa ku munu. Nyambe wa kusepahala mi katamba okupumena nji mwetekiwe okubitelela okongola kwenu, kono omuliko ni onyene kame so mibe endila no kumatuka nji mutwese okoongola. <verse eid="1CO 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 10:14"/>Cwalehe, abange, mucile okulapela emilimu. <verse eid="1CO 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 10:15"/>Kame naamba kanyi kwaanu no kuyupisisa, mu kwatule mwenyene kweyi naamba. <verse eid="1CO 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 10:16"/>Ekomoki no mbuyoti eyi tu fuyaulelwa kasa nji kame tutabelwa ku unyinga wa Kilesite? Esinkwa esi tu patola, kasa nji kame tu tabelwa ku lutu lwa Kilesite? <verse eid="1CO 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 10:17"/>Kakuli kame kuli esinkwa simweya, aci no kupula kame tuli olutu lumweya kakuli kame tulya esinkwa simweya.<verse eid="1CO 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 10:18"/>Mu mone Amaisilaele, kasa okame awo alya amatabelo mu aletale? <verse eid="1CO 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 10:19"/>Iikene sa naambe cwale? Siya silya sibekelwa emilimu nisinu simba omulimu sinu? <verse eid="1CO 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 10:20"/>Kokuulwa! Kame naamba nji eyo itendiwa esitabelo kame ibiwa ku madimona mi kasa kwa Nyambe. Ka nisingi nji mukuwane ni madimona. <verse eid="1CO 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 10:21"/>Ka mutwese oku nwena mu komoki ya Mbumu ni mu komoki no madimona. Ka mutwese okulyela ba tafule ya Mbumu ni ba tafule no madimona. <verse eid="1CO 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 10:22"/>Kame tutwesa okushamaeta Ombumu mu muna? Kame tumu bita ku maata?<verse eid="1CO 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 10:23"/>“Einu yonje kame ilumelelwe,” kono kasanji einu yonje kame ili ni tuso. “Einu yonje kame ilumelelwe,” kono kasanji yonje kame iyakisa. <verse eid="1CO 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 10:24"/>Omunu alese okusaela ouwa waye yomboci kono ni uwa no akwaye.<verse eid="1CO 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 10:25"/>Mu lye yonje eyi yulisiwa mu musika no nyama, okuulwile okwibanguta esinjili mulibaka no lizwalo. <verse eid="1CO 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 10:26"/>Kakuli “Elitunga ni lya Mbumu, neyi ilimo yonje.”<verse eid="1CO 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 10:27"/>Nji omunjili kwawo no kwapumena kame akumemela ku kulya mi nupumene okutako, olye yonje eyo inabekiwa balubala lowe okuulwile okwibanguta epuzo imweya mulibaka no lizwalo. <verse eid="1CO 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 10:28"/>Kono omunu kame aamba kwawene nji, “Esi na silitiwa mu sitabelo,” abo olese okulya mulibaka lyawoyo ona kwambele ni mulibaka no lizwalo. <verse eid="1CO 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 10:29"/>Kame nitalusa elizwalo lyaye kasa elizwalo lyowe olese okusilya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 10:29">Kakuli ngasibine etukuluho yange aba yatuliwa ku lizwalo no munu munjili? <verse eid="1CO 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 10:30"/>Cwale nji kame nilya nukutumela, iikene aba nishendaulelwa kweso nina kutumele?<verse eid="1CO 10:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 10:31"/>Cwale naba mu lya, naba mu nwa, naba mu tenda esinu sinjili, mu tende einu yonje nji Nyambe ayemiwe mulibaka lyayo. <verse eid="1CO 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 10:32"/>Mulese okuba omubonda ku Majuda, simba ku Mangelike, simba ku keleke ya Nyambe. <verse eid="1CO 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 10:33"/>Kanyi omo netekela oku wabelisa aanu onje mu inu yonje eyi nitenda, kasa okusaela ouwa wange fela, kono ni uwa no aanu no kupula nji ayoyisiwe.<verse eid="1CO 10:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1CO 11"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 11:1"/>Mu nifanikete, kanyi mene aba ni faniketa Kilesite.<verse eid="1CO 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mukufuke ku Mutwi aba ku Lapeliwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 11:2"/>Kame ni miyema kakuli kame mu ni puluka mu inu yonje mi kame mu mamela eizo simba aba nina kumiba yoo. <verse eid="1CO 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 11:3"/>Kono kame ni singa nji mu limuke nji omutwi no mulume yonje ni Kilesite, mi omutwi no mukati mbumwaye, mi omutwi wa Kilesite, Nyambe. <verse eid="1CO 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 11:4"/>Omunu yonje woyo olapela simba okunuha yo kufukile ku mutwi waye kame ashubula omutwi waye. <verse eid="1CO 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 11:5"/>Kono omukati yonje woyo olapela simba okunuha yoka kufukile ku mutwi waye, kame ashubula omutwi waye kakuli ni sinu simweya kanyi kame abeulilwe etin̄uki ku mutwi waye. <verse eid="1CO 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 11:6"/>Kakuli omukati nji ka kufuku sinjili ku mutwi, cwale abeule etin̄uki taye. Kono nji kame kwenisa omukati okubeuliwa simba okutundisa etin̄uki, akufuke esinjili ku mutwi waye. <verse eid="1CO 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 11:7"/>Kakuli omulume ka fanene okufuka ekuwani ku mutwi, kakuli yonyene ni sifekiso ni kanya ya Nyambe. Kono omukati ni kanya ya mulume. <verse eid="1CO 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 11:8"/>Kakuli omulume kasi kuumbiwa ba mukati kono omukati yona kuumbiwa ba mulume. <verse eid="1CO 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 11:9"/>Mi kame omulume kasi umbiwa mulibaka no mukati, kono omukati naku umbiwa mulibaka no mulume. <verse eid="1CO 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 11:10"/>Mulibaka elyo omukati kame afanena okufuka esinu ku mutwi waye, mulibaka no mangeloi. <verse eid="1CO 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 11:11"/>Simbakulingeso mwa Mbumu omukati olukuluhile konji ni mulume, simba omulume konji ni mukati. <verse eid="1CO 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 11:12"/>Kakuli kanyi omukati aba ana kuumbiwa ba mulume, ni yonyene omulume kame aleyiwa ku mukati, mi einu yonje kame itunda kwa Nyambe.<verse eid="1CO 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 11:13"/>Mu kwatula mwenyene nji kame kufanena omukati okulapela Nyambe yoka kufukile esinjili ku mutwi. <verse eid="1CO 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 11:14"/>Kasa nji omwikalelo wonyene kame utwiyeta nji omulume aba aikala ni tin̄uki no kuleba kame aku shubula, <verse eid="1CO 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 11:15"/>kono nji omukati kame ali ni tin̄uki no kuleba kwa yonyene kwa kuwaba. Kakuli kame anabiwi etin̄uki kanyi olwambi lufuka omutwi. <verse eid="1CO 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 11:16"/>Nji omunu kame asinga oku lita etin̄ananyi, omukwa owo kausako kwaaci, simba mu tikeleke ta Nyambe.<verse eid="1CO 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Omulalelo wa Mbumu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-29">Mateu26.26-29</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-25">Maleka14.22-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luka22.14-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 11:17"/>Kono mu titaelo titatamako kani mi yeme, kakuli aba mukuwana bamweya, kasa okulita eyi no kuwaba kono eyi no kwiiba. <verse eid="1CO 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 11:18"/>Kakuli a matatekelo, aba muna kukuwana kanyi keleke kame ni yupa nji kame kuli ni tifapano mukaci kenu mi abanjili kame ni pumena. <verse eid="1CO 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 11:19"/>Kakuli oukutaba kame kufanena okwikalako mukaci kenu mulibaka nji awo no niti mukaci kenu amonahale. <verse eid="1CO 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 11:20"/>Cwale aba mukuwana bamweya, kasa omulalelo wa Mbumu owo mulya. <verse eid="1CO 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 11:21"/>Kakuli aba kuliwa, munu ni munu kame alelubela okulya ku mulalelo waye, mi omunjili kame anafu elishebo mi omunjili na koliwa. <verse eid="1CO 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 11:22"/>Iikene! kamu kwite etindoo no kulyelamo ni kunwenamo? Simba nji kamu kuteka ekeleke ya Nyambe ni kukwenisa awo aulwile? Iikene sa naambe kwaanyi? Ni mi yeme mwesi? Kokuulwa kanimi yeme.<verse eid="1CO 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 11:23"/>Kakuli kame nina tambula okutunda kwa Mbumu esi nina mibi, nji Ombumu Jesu, mu usiku aba ana ku betekiwa, sebeli oshimba esinkwa, <verse eid="1CO 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 11:24"/>mi cwale aba anaku mana outumela, sebeli osipatola, ni kwamba nji, “Olu nilutu lwange luna cokele anyi. Mu tende esi nji muni puluke. <verse eid="1CO 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 11:25"/>Mundila imweya, aba ana kumana oku lalela sebeli oshimba kame ekomoki ni kwamba nji, “Ekomoki eyi okame oulikani no ubya oli mu unyinga wange. Enako yonge aba munwamo mutende esi nji mu nipuluke.”<verse eid="1CO 11:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 11:26"/>Kakuli mu nako yonje aba mulya esinkwa esi ni kunwa mu komoki, mwambe elifu lya Mbumu konji aba saiye. <verse eid="1CO 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 11:27"/>Cwalehe omunu yonje woyo olya ku sinkwa ni kunwa mu komoki ya Mbumu mu mukwa no kwa fanena, kame ali ni sibi mu lutu ni mu unyinga wa Mbumu. <verse eid="1CO 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 11:28"/>Munu ni munu aku tatube yonyene, mi cwale alye ku sinkwa ni kunwa mu komoki. <verse eid="1CO 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 11:29"/>Kakuli omunu yonje woyo olya ni kunwa yo ka lemuha olutu lwa Mbumu kame aku lyela ni uku nwena ekatulo kame ili beulu yaye. <verse eid="1CO 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 11:30"/>Mulibakelyo ano kupula kwanyi kame afokola ni ku toma, mi anjili naafu. <verse eid="1CO 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 11:31"/>Kono nji kame tukwatula twenyene mu niti, kambe ka tutamba okwatuliwa. <verse eid="1CO 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 11:32"/>Kono aba twatuliwa kwa Mbumu kame tu kalimelwa kwa yonyene nji cwale tulese oku nyaziwa ni litunga.<verse eid="1CO 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 11:33"/>Cwalehe abange, aba muku wanena ba kulya, mu ku tatelele omunjili ku munjili. <verse eid="1CO 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 11:34"/>Nji omunu kame ayombile, alye ku mundi, nji oukuwana kwenu ku lese oku miwanisa okunyazahala. Mi einu injili mba niilukisa aba niiya.<verse eid="1CO 11:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1CO 12"/>
  <para style="s">Etimpo okutunda ku Mebo No Kukena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 12:1"/>Abaange, cwale okukumanena ni timpo no mebo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 12:1">Ka nisingi nji mu ulwe okusimwetiwa. <verse eid="1CO 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 12:2"/>Kame muyii nji aba muna kwikala memuli anokwalimuka Nyambe kame muna kukokelwa ku milimu no kwamba, omo muna kutundisiwa. <verse eid="1CO 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 12:3"/>Cwalehe kame nisinga nji anyi muyupisise nji kakwisa omunu woyo wamba ni Mebo ya Nyambe woyo swamba nji, “Jesu akutiwe!” Mi kakwisa woyo swamba nji, “Jesu ni Mbumu”, konji woyo otwaletelwa ni Mebo No Kukena.<verse eid="1CO 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 12:4"/>Cwale etimpo kame tiku tabile kono Emebo niimweya. <verse eid="1CO 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 12:5"/>Mi kame kuli oukusiya ku misebezi kono Mbumu ni mumweya. <verse eid="1CO 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 12:6"/>Cwale kame kuli emisebezi no kwakufeka, kono Nyambe nimumweya woyo osebeza emisebezi yonje nikwibeeka mwaanu onje. <verse eid="1CO 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 12:7"/>Ku munu yonje kame anabiwi ku Mebo no sinn̄ulo kuuwa no munu yonje. <verse eid="1CO 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 12:8"/>Kakuli okukumanena mu Mebo imweya omunu munjili kame abiwa amaywi no kushangama, omunjili kame abiwa amaywi no zibo. <verse eid="1CO 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 12:9"/>Omunjili kame atambula etumelo kwa yonyene Emebo eyo, omunjili kame atambula empo no kubalisa ameeti ku yonyene Emebo imweya. <verse eid="1CO 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 12:10"/>Ku munjili kame abiwa amaata no kutenda etimakazo, omunjili kame abiwa okunuha, omunjili okulimuka emebo, omunjili etipuo no kushutana-shutana omunjili etaluso no tipuo. <verse eid="1CO 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 12:11"/>Eyo yonje kame isebezwa ku yonyene Emebo imweya, woyo otabela omunjli ni munjili omo asingela.<verse eid="1CO 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Olutu Lumweya lukwite Eilama no Kupula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 12:12"/>Kakuli olutu kanyi aba luli lumweya, mi kame luli ni eilama no kupula, eilama yonje no lutu naba ili eyi no kupula kono kame itendile olutu lumweya, Kilesite ni yonyene kame ali ngeso. <verse eid="1CO 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 12:13"/>Kakuli tonje kame tuna kolobeziwa mu Mebo imweya, nji tutende olutu lumweya, simba Amajuda simba Amagelike, simba awo ali muukoba simba awo no kulukuluha mi tonje natu nwisiwa ku Mebo imweya. <verse eid="1CO 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 12:14"/>Kakuli olutu kalukwite esilama simweya, kono kame lukwite eilama no kupula. <verse eid="1CO 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 12:15"/>Nji elikondo kame lyamba nji, “Kakuli kamene elyoko, sisako ku lutu,” eso kasitamba okumonisa nji elikondo ni lyonyene kame lili esilama no lutu. <verse eid="1CO 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 12:16"/>Mi nji elitwi kame lyamba nji, “Kakuli kasa mene elitiyo sisako ku lutu,” eso kasitamba okumonisa nji kalisako ku lutu. <verse eid="1CO 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 12:17"/>Kambe olutu lonje kame lutendile elitiyo fela, kambe ngasibine satuyupe? Mi olutu lonje kambe neli elitwi feela kambe ngasibine satuyupe eyi inuka? <verse eid="1CO 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 12:18"/>Kono kanyi omo kwikalele, Nyambe naku lukisa eilama mu lutu esinjili ni sinjili omo ana kusingela. <verse eid="1CO 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 12:19"/>Kambe olutu neli silama simweya fela kambe olutu kubine luli? <verse eid="1CO 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 12:20"/>Kanyi omo kwikalele nji eilama niya kupula, kono olutu ni lumweya.<verse eid="1CO 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 12:21"/>Elitiyo kalitwese okwambela elyoko nji, “Ku kwite tuso kwa mene!” Simba omutwi kautwese okwambela amakondo nji, “Ku kwite tuso kwa mene!” <verse eid="1CO 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 12:22"/>Niti luli mane eilama no lutu eyi imonahala oku fokola onene yokame eyi noutokwa onene, <verse eid="1CO 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 12:23"/>mi eilama no lutu eyi tu yambuta nji kaikwite elikute, yokame eyi tukuteka ni ku bitelela, cwale eilama yetu eyi yenenwa kame tuibabalela ni likute eli no kubitelela onene, <verse eid="1CO 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 12:24"/>eyi tubuha onene ka isaele esinjili. Kono Nyambe na waneke olutu, mi elikute no ku bitelela kame ana libi eilama eyi yulwile. <verse eid="1CO 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 12:25"/>Nji oukutaba ku tendiwe mu lutu, kono eilama iku babalele esinjili ku sinjili. <verse eid="1CO 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 12:26"/>Mi esilama simweya aba siyupa okukola, eilama yonje kame iyupa okukola bamweya, mi esilama sinjili aba si lumbiwa, eilama yonje kame iwabelelwa bamweya.<verse eid="1CO 12:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 12:27"/>Cwale aanyi olutu lwa Kilesite mi kame mu tendile injili yaye. <verse eid="1CO 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 12:28"/>Mi Nyambe awo ana beeke mu keleke, oweli na tumiwa, ano wili nanuhi ano waatu asikwiyeta, nawo ana ku biwa amaata no kutenda etimakazo, nasi timpo no kubalisa, nasi kutusa, naendisi, nasikwamba etipuo no mifuta injili. <verse eid="1CO 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 12:29"/>Ninji onje natumiwa? Ninji onje nanuhi? Kamba onje naiyeti? Ninji onje awo kame atenda etimakazo? <verse eid="1CO 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 12:30"/>Ninji onje kame ali ni mpo no kubalisa? Kamba onje kame aamba etipuo? Kamba onje kame atalusa etipuo? <verse eid="1CO 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 12:31"/>Kono ni micima yenu yonje mulakaza etimpo tinene.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 12:31">Mi cwale nisi mimonisa endila eyi ibitelela onene ku uwa.<verse eid="1CO 12:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1CO 13"/>
  <para style="s">Elilato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 13:1"/>Cwale aba sanambe etipuo no aanu neti no Mangeloi, aba ni ulwile elilato, kame nili omulangu fela owo ulila, simba engonge no mulumo no kuneneba. <verse eid="1CO 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 13:2"/>Mi naaba sani ikale ni mpo no kunuha, mi kame ni yii eyi ishwekilwe yonje ni kushangama konje, nji kame nili ni tumelo mane kame ni shimbulula amalundu, kono kani kwite elilato abo sikwite tuso. <verse eid="1CO 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 13:3"/>Mi nabasa nibe eyi ni luwile yonje, simba abasa ni kutobohe olutu lwange nji lucin̄iwe kono sikwite elilato kakwisa esi sani wanebo.<verse eid="1CO 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 13:4"/>Elilato kame lili ni mucima no kuwaba, kame lili ni musa, elilato kali kwite omuna nukukumusa, <verse eid="1CO 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 13:5"/>Elilato kali tende eyi yenisa ni mahanyi, elilato kaliku kandimeke lyonyene kali imana ba titukelo lyato, kali twese okutwebisa, simba okuteula ouyi, <verse eid="1CO 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 13:6"/>kali wabelele eyi no kwaluka, kono kame liwabelelwa eyi no kuluka. <verse eid="1CO 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 13:7"/>Elilato kame li shimba einu yonje, kono kame lipumena einu yonje ni kusepa einu yonje mane nukoongota mu inu yonje.<verse eid="1CO 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 13:8"/>Elilato kali tamba okubwa, okuta oku no kwaabwa, kono anuhi onyene mbaabu simbe etipuo kame sati leselwe okwambiwa, simba ezibo mba ibu. <verse eid="1CO 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 13:9"/>Kakuli oku limuka kwetu ni kwa kuulwa eniti ni ku nuha kwetu ni kwakuulwa enit, <verse eid="1CO 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 13:10"/>kono einu no ku petahala enako saiye, eyi na kwa luka mba ibu.<verse eid="1CO 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 13:11"/>Aba nina kwikala ni sili omwana, kame nina kwamba kanyi omwana, kame nina ku nahananga kanyi mwanukana, kame ni na kupulukanga kanyi mwana, kono aba nina kulu oku tenda omulume, sebeli ni siya eyi no wanukana. <verse eid="1CO 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 13:12"/>Mu nako ino, kame tu mona ni siponi, mu uwi kono enako icana, olubala mba lu monana ni lubala mu nako ino, cwale kame ni limuka banyonyo simba nji kame nina kuyupisisa.<verse eid="1CO 13:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 13:13"/>Cwale etumelo, ni sepo, mane ni lilato yonje eyo yaatu kame ili bamweya, kono esi no ku neneba kweeyo ni lilato.<verse eid="1CO 13:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1CO 14"/>
  <para style="s">Eino Kupula kweyi no timpo okutunda ku Mebo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 14:1"/>Mu kon̄e endila no lilato, luli mu lakaze etimpo no mebo, onene eyi no unuhi. <verse eid="1CO 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 14:2"/>Kakuli woyo wamba etipuo kaamba ku munu, kono kame aamba kwa Nyambe, kakuli kakwisa woyo omu yupisisa. Kono mu Mebo kame aamba eyi no kwalimukiwa. <verse eid="1CO 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 14:3"/>Ku lineku linjili woyo onuha kame aamba kwaanu eyi iyakisa, eyi isusuweza neyi yongota. <verse eid="1CO 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 14:4"/>Woyo wamba mu tipuo kame akoongota yomboci, kono woyo onuha kame atusa ekeleke. <verse eid="1CO 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 14:5"/>Cwale kame nisinga nji anyi monje mwambe mu tipuo, kono simba onene mu kunuha. Kakuli woyo onuha kame abitelela woyo wamba mu tipuo, konji omunjili aba satoloke nji cwale ekeleke yongole. <verse eid="1CO 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 14:6"/>Cwale abaange, nji kame niiya kwaanyi me naamba mu tipuo, ngasibine sani mituse? Konji aba sani militele eyi nina shotolelwe no sinulo, simba ezibo, simba eyi no unuhi, simba eyi no kwiyeta?<verse eid="1CO 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 14:7"/>Nji simba einu nokutusisa nambulwa moyo kanyi epala, simba ehalepa nji kame itundisa omulumo nokwa limukiwa wino, ngaibi omo salimukele omunu nji iikene eyo ipetiwa? <verse eid="1CO 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 14:8"/>Mi etolombita aba ipetiwa omulumo no kwa yupahala wino, anyine woyo so ku tukiseta endwaa? <verse eid="1CO 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 14:9"/>Mumukwanongeso, naanyi nji kame mwamba eyi no kwa yupahala, ngasibine sa limuke omunu eso sinambiwa? Kakuli kame samu kwambele mu mebo. <verse eid="1CO 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 14:10"/>Mu litunga kame kuli emifuta no kupula no mishobo, mi kakwisa owo ulwile etaluso. <verse eid="1CO 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 14:11"/>Kono simba nji kani yii etaluso no mushobo kame sanitende woyo no kwalimukiwa kwa woyo waamba mi woyo waamba kame satende woyo no kwalimukiwa kwa mene. <verse eid="1CO 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 14:12"/>Cwale naanyi kanyi aba mulakaza etimpo no Mebo, mu tundamene okutwalelela mu kuyaka ekeleke.<verse eid="1CO 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 14:13"/>Cwalehe woyo wamba mu tipuo alapele nji atwese okutoloka. <verse eid="1CO 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 14:14"/>Kakuli nji kame nilapela mu puo, emebo yange kame ilapela, kono oku yupisisa kwange ka kukwite embuya. <verse eid="1CO 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 14:15"/>Cwale iikene sanitende? Kame sa ni lapele ni mebo, mane kame sani lapele ni kuyupisisa ngeso, kame sani imbe ni mebo, ni imbe ngeso ni kuyupisisa. <verse eid="1CO 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 14:16"/>Abakulingeso, nji kame ufuyola ni mebo, ngasibine omunjili woyo oli mu sibaka nwawo ali kundee okwamba “Ameni” kuukutumela kowe abo yokalimukile eyo wamba. <verse eid="1CO 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 14:17"/>Kakuli kame ufanena okutumela wino, kono omunjili katusiwa.<verse eid="1CO 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 14:18"/>Kame ni ku tumela kwa Nyambe kakuli kame naamba mu tipuo okumibita monje. <verse eid="1CO 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 14:19"/>Nabakulingeso, mu keleke kame nitwesa fela okwamba amaywi no kukwana atanu ao ayupisisa aanu mulibaka no kwiyeta akwange okubita amaywi akwana eikiti likumi mu puo.<verse eid="1CO 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 14:20"/>Abaange, mulese oku tenda kanyi anukana mu kunahana, mutende kanyi anukana mu inu no kwiiba, kono mu kunahana mutende kanyi akulu. <verse eid="1CO 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 14:21"/>Mu mulawo kame kun̄olilwe nji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 14:21">“Mulibaka no anu no tipuo tindina.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 14:21">Ni tunwa no anu awo atunda ku ndina</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 14:21">Kame sanambe kwaanu aa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 14:21">mi naba saulwe okuyupeteta kwa mene, kame kwaamba Ombumu.”<verse eid="1CO 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 14:22"/>Abakulingeso etipuo katitendile esisupo no anu awo apumena, kono kwawo no kwa pumena, cwale ounuhi kasa wao no kwa pumena, kono niwa asiku pumena.<verse eid="1CO 14:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 14:23"/>Cwalehe, nji ekeleke yonje kame ikuwanine bamweya mi anu onje kame aamba mu tipuo, mi awo ali kundee simba anokwa pumena aba aingena, katamba kwamba nji kame mu pulumuka? <verse eid="1CO 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 14:24"/>Kono nji onje kame anuha mi awo nokwa pumena simba awo ali kundee aba aingena, kame akolwisiwa kwa onyene onje nji kame ali ni uyi mi kame atulwa kwa onyene onje. <verse eid="1CO 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 14:25"/>Eyi ishwekilwe mu mucima waye kame sa ishootoke, mi cwale kame akubama balubala ni ku lumbeka Nyambe, mane aambe nji, luli Nyambe mwaali mwaanyi.<verse eid="1CO 14:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Etukelo mu Keleke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 14:26"/>Abange ku tendiwe ngaibi? Aba mu kuwana, munu ni munu kwaanyi kame sa ikale ni lusimo, simba etuto, simba sinulo, simba epuo, simba etaluso no tipuo. Einu yonje itendwe mu kuyakisa. <verse eid="1CO 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 14:27"/>Nji omunjili kame aamba mu puo, kwaambe ayiili, simba aatu, mu kube esibaka mi omunjili atoloke. <verse eid="1CO 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 14:28"/>Kono nji kakwisa woyo otwesa okutoloka, cwale onje aondoke mu keleke mi akwambele yomboci ni kwa Nyambe. <verse eid="1CO 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 14:29"/>Kwaambe anuhi ayiili simba aatu mi anjili aatule esi sambiwa. <verse eid="1CO 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 14:30"/>Nji etaba kame sinuliwa kwa woyo oikalile kunyonga, cwale woyo no weli aondoke. <verse eid="1CO 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 14:31"/>Kakuli kame mutwesa okunuha monje, nji cwale onje akwiyete mi onje asusuweziwe. <verse eid="1CO 14:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 14:32"/>Emebo no anuhi kame ibusiwa kwa nuhi. <verse eid="1CO 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 14:33"/>Kakuli Nyambe kasa Nyambe no mifilifili, kono ni wa kozo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 14:33">Kanyi omo ku tendelwa mu tikeleke toonje no anu no kukena a Nyambe, <verse eid="1CO 14:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 14:34"/>mi akati aondoke mu tikeleke, ka lumelelwe okwamba, kono kame afanene oku beeka kunji, kanyi omulawo aba wamba. <verse eid="1CO 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 14:35"/>Nji kame kuli eso alakaza okulimuka, kame atwesa okwibanguta ambumoo ku ndoo. Kakuli kame kwenisa akati okwamba mu keleke. <verse eid="1CO 14:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 14:36"/>Iikene! ninji eliywi lya Nyambe oku lina tangisete okwiiya ni kwaanyi? Simba nji anyi fela awo ana waniwa kwa lyonyene? <verse eid="1CO 14:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 14:37"/>Nji omunjili kame anahana nji omunuhi wa Nyambe, simba omunu oli ni mebo, kame afanena okulimuka nji eyi nimi n̄olela kame itendile etaelo ya Mbumu. <verse eid="1CO 14:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 14:38"/>Nji omunjili kalimuka eye, ni yonyene kalimukiwa.<verse eid="1CO 14:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 14:39"/>Cwalehe, abaange, mongotete okunuha mane mulese okukwangwa okwamba mu tipuo. <verse eid="1CO 14:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 14:40"/>Kono einu yonje itendwe mu ku fanena, ni mu mulawo.<verse eid="1CO 14:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1CO 15"/>
  <para style="s">Okwinguka kwa Kilesite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 15:1"/>Abaange, kame ni mipulukisa eliywi no kuwaba ni na kumi kutaza, yonyene eyo mu na tambula, eyo mongolela kwa yonyene. <verse eid="1CO 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 15:2"/>Eyi mu yoyisiwa nayo, nji kame mwilema mukoongola, konji mwendi nji okupumena kwenu ni kwambango. <verse eid="1CO 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 15:3"/>Kakuli kame nina mibi kwesi no utokwa no weli esi nina tambula, nji Kilesite kame ana kufela eibi yetu, okukumanena nomu ina n̄olelwe mu man̄olo, <verse eid="1CO 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 15:4"/>nji kame ana ku pumbekiwa, mane sebeli oingulwa eli no waatu, okukumanena nomo ku n̄olelwe mu man̄olo, <verse eid="1CO 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 15:5"/>mi cwale sebeli omonahala kwa Kefasi, cwale sebeli omonahala kwa ano kukwana likumi ni twiili. <verse eid="1CO 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 15:6"/>Cwale sebeli okumonahaza kwaanu no kubitelela emyanda itanu banako imweya, mane anjili asiyoya simba nji anjili naafu. <verse eid="1CO 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 15:7"/>Cwale sebeli omonahala kwa Jakobo, mane ni kwaatumiwa onje.<verse eid="1CO 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 15:8"/>Cwale ku mamaneneno sebeli okumonahaza mane ni kwa mene esifolozwani. <verse eid="1CO 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 15:9"/>Kakuli ya mene omucana kwa tumiwa onje, mi kani lukele okwisaniwa omutumiwa, kakuli kame nina kuyandisa ekeleke ya Nyambe. <verse eid="1CO 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 15:10"/>Kono mu sishemo sa Nyambe aba nili eso niliso mi esishemo saye kwa mene ka sambango. Kono kame nina sebeze onene okubita onyene onje, simba nji kasa mene, kono ni sishemo sa Nyambe esi sili kwa mene. <verse eid="1CO 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 15:11"/>Cwale simba ya mene, simba onyene, sokame esi tuna kutaza, mi sokame muna pumene.<verse eid="1CO 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Okwinguka kwetu Kwaafu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 15:12"/>Aba kwiyetwa nji Kilesite kame ana kwingulwa kwaafu, iikene aba aamba anjili kwaanyi nji kakwisa okwinguka nwaafu? <verse eid="1CO 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 15:13"/>Kono kambe kakwisa okwinguka nwaafu, kambe ni yonyene Kilesite kasi kwingulwa kwaafu. <verse eid="1CO 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 15:14"/>Mi Kilesite nji kasi ingulwa kwaafu, cwale oku kutaza kwetu ni kwambango, mi ni tumelo yenu ni ya mbango. <verse eid="1CO 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 15:15"/>Kame mbatu waniwa nji kame tuli apaki a Nyambe no mapwa, kakuli natu paka nji Nyambe naingula Kilesite, kono nji ni niti nji aafu kaingulwa, abo cwale Nyambe kasikwingula Kilesite. <verse eid="1CO 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 15:16"/>Kakuli nji aafu katamba okwingulwa, abohe, Kilesite ni yonyene kasi kwingulwa. <verse eid="1CO 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 15:17"/>Nji Kilesite kasi kwingulwa, etumelo yenu kaikwite tuso mi mu sili mu ibi yenu. <verse eid="1CO 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 15:18"/>Abakulingeso, awo ana fele mwa Kilesite kame ana felele. <verse eid="1CO 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 15:19"/>Nji kame tu sepile Kilesite mu moyo uno fela, cwale kame atuyupele amakeke okubita aanu onje. <verse eid="1CO 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 15:20"/>Kono cwale eniti ninji, Kilesite na kwingulwa kwaafu, mi yokame omutamuno nwawo anafu. <verse eid="1CO 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 15:21"/>Kakuli kanyi olufu aba luna iyi mulibaka no munu, ni konyene okwinguka nwaafu kame ku neyi mulibaka no munu. <verse eid="1CO 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 15:22"/>Kakuli kanyi aanu onje aba afa mwa Adama, mumukwanongeso onje mba yoyo ngeso kame mwa Kilesite. <verse eid="1CO 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 15:23"/>Kono omunu ni munu mba inguka mu nako yaye ifanena Kilesite yo mutamuno no weli bokame awo ali a Kilesite mba ingulwa aba saiye. <verse eid="1CO 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 15:24"/>Cwale kame sa kwiiye amamaneneno aba sabe omubuso kwa Nyambe Sitetu munyima no kusinya omulawo onje, ni tukelo ni maata. <verse eid="1CO 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 15:25"/>Kakuli kame sabuse oku twala abo sa kabeekele eila yaye yonje munji no makondo aye. <verse eid="1CO 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 15:26"/>Esila no mamaneneno ku kusinyiwa ni lifu. <verse eid="1CO 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 15:27"/>Kakuli Nyambe kame ana beeke einu yonje munji no makondo aye. Mi aba kwambiwa nji, “Einu yonje kame ina bekiwa munji yaye.” Kame ku yupahala nji woyo ona ibeke munji yaye ka baliwako. <verse eid="1CO 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 15:28"/>Cwale einu yonje aba ina kumana okubekiwa munji yaye, abohe ni yonyene omwana mba bekiwa mu maata aye woyo ona beeke einu yonje munji yaye, nji Nyambe abeeke einu yonje ku munu yonje.<verse eid="1CO 15:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 15:29"/>Abakulingeso, iikene eyo atalusa aanu aba akolobezwa mulibaka nwaafu? Aafu nji luli katamba okwingulwa, iikene aba akolobeleziwa mulibaka lyoo? <verse eid="1CO 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 15:30"/>Iikene aba ni yoya mu tikozi mu nako yonje? <verse eid="1CO 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 15:31"/>Abaange, kame naamba eniti, mulibaka no kuyeema kwange mwaanyi oko nili nako mwa Kilesite Jesu Ombumu wetu, kame nifa ba liywaa ni liywaa. <verse eid="1CO 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 15:32"/>Iikene nina wana nji kame naamba mu mukwa no unu fela, kame ninalwi ni “iyamana” mu Efese? Nji aafu katamba okwingulwa, “Tulyenihe ni kunwa kakuli byuunda mbatufu.”<verse eid="1CO 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 15:33"/>Mulese okoongiwa. “Einu no kwiiba kame isinya ouwa.” <verse eid="1CO 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 15:34"/>Mwiye mu mihupulo yenu no kuluka mi mulese okutenda esibi kame. Kakuli anjili kalimukile Nyambe, kame ni myambela eyo nji mweene.<verse eid="1CO 15:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Olutu luna Inguka Kwaafu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 15:35"/>Kono omunjili kame saibangute nji, “Ngasibine omo saingulelwe aafu? Kame saiye ni lutu no ngasibine?” <verse eid="1CO 15:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 15:36"/>Wene omwelo no mulume! Eso ukuna kasitamba okuyoya, konji aba sasife oweli. <verse eid="1CO 15:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 15:37"/>Cwale aba ukuna, ka ukunu olutu olu sa lwiye, kono kame ukuna embuto eyi inamene, mwendi ni ya uloto, simba eyi no mbuto indina. <verse eid="1CO 15:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 15:38"/>Kono Nyambe kame aba embuto olutu omo asingela, mi kame aba embuto injili ni injili olutu lwayo.<verse eid="1CO 15:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 15:39"/>Kakuli olutu lonje kalukufekile, kono aanu kame ali ni lutu lumweya lukufekile, eiyamana lundina, otuyunyi ni lundina mane ni tindi ni lundina.<verse eid="1CO 15:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 15:40"/>Cwale kame kuli etinyutu na kuwilu, ni tinyutu no ba litunga, kono ekanya no tinyutu na kuwilu indina, ni kanya no ba litunga indina. <verse eid="1CO 15:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CO 15:41"/>Ekanya no liywaa ni indina, ni kanya no kweti ni indina, ni kanya no tinungweti ni indina, kakuli olutungweti ni lutungweti kame luku siile ku kanya ni lunjili.<verse eid="1CO 15:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CO 15:42"/>Mo sakwikalele ngeso niba kwinguka nwaafu. Eso sikuniwa sonje kame sifa, mi eso siingulwa kasifi. <verse eid="1CO 15:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CO 15:43"/>Kame ikuniwa mu kwakutekiwa, mi kame ingulwa mu kanya, kame ikuniwa mu kufokola mi kame ingulwa mu maata. <verse eid="1CO 15:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CO 15:44"/>Kame lupumbekiwa oluli olutu no unu, kame sa lwinguke oluli olutu no mebo. Nji kame kuli olutu no unu, ni lutu no mebo koluli kame. <verse eid="1CO 15:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CO 15:45"/>Kakuli mo kun̄olelwe nji, “Omulume no weli Adama, kame ana tendiwa omunu no kuyoya, mi Adama no mamaneneno kame ana tendiwa Emebo ibiwa no kuyoyisa. <verse eid="1CO 15:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CO 15:46"/>Kono kasa mebo eyo ili no weli, kono lutu, okubinda cwale emebo. <verse eid="1CO 15:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CO 15:47"/>Omunu no weli kame ana kutunda ba litunga, ona kuumbiwa ba liluli cwale omulume no wili kame ana kutunda ku wilu. <verse eid="1CO 15:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CO 15:48"/>Omo aikalele omulume woyo otunda ba liluli, mwaikalele ni woyo otunda ba liluli, mi omo aikalele woyo otunda ku wilu, mwaikalele nawo atunda ku wilu. <verse eid="1CO 15:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CO 15:49"/>Kanyi omo tukufukele esifekiso no mulume woyo ona umbiwa ba liluli, mba tukufeke ngeso esifekiso no mulume woyo otunda ku wilu.<verse eid="1CO 15:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CO 15:50"/>Abaange, kame nimyambela esi nji, olutu ni unyinga kaitwese okuyola omubuso wa Nyambe, simba eso sifa kasi tamba okuyola eso no kwaafa.<verse eid="1CO 15:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CO 15:51"/>Komumone! Kame ni myambela etaba eyi ina ku shwekiwa. Katu tamba okufa tonje, kono kame satu futuke tonje. <verse eid="1CO 15:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CO 15:52"/>Mu nako imweya, mu ku koba no litiyo, ba tolombita no mamaneneno. Kakuli etolombita mba ilili, mi aafu mba ingulwa atendile ano kwaafa, mi naaci mba tu futuka. <verse eid="1CO 15:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CO 15:53"/>Kakuli eso soola mbasi kufuku esi no kwaola, mi esi sifa mbasi kufuku esi no kwaafa. <verse eid="1CO 15:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CO 15:54"/>Esi soola, enako sa sikufuke okwaola, mi esi sifa kame sikufuka okwafa, abohe mba ku tendahala eliywi eli li na kun̄oliwa, eli lyaamba nji, “Elifu kame li na miniwa ku kukoma!”<verse eid="1CO 15:54"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CO 15:55"/>Wene olufu, okukoma kowe ku bine kuli?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 15:55">Wene elufu omulyashinji wowe ni kubine?<verse eid="1CO 15:55"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1CO 15:56"/>Omulyashinji no lufu ni sibi, mi amaata no sibi ni mulawo wa Mushe. <verse eid="1CO 15:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1CO 15:57"/>Tuku tumele kwa Nyambe woyo ona tubi okukoma mu libaka no Mbumu wetu Jesu Kilesite.<verse eid="1CO 15:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="1CO 15:58"/>Cwale abaange aa asingwa, mongole, mulese oku zikinyeha, mi mongote enako yonje omusebezi wa Mbumu memu yii nji omusebezi wenu no ku bambaba kautamba okutenda ou nambulwa tuso kwa Mbumu.<verse eid="1CO 15:58"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1CO 16"/>
  <para style="s">Enubu no Akwetu Alumeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 16:1"/>Kweyi no koleko eyi etendelwa asikupumena, mu tende omu nina laelele etikeleke no Galatiya. <verse eid="1CO 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 16:2"/>Eli no Sunda lyonje, omunu ni munu kwaanyi abeeke ku nyonga yaye esi ana waneke, mu ku faniketa kwesi ana biwi, nji etikoleko tileswe oku tendiwa aba niiya. <verse eid="1CO 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 16:3"/>Mi abasa ni keele, aa muna kete, kame sana tume ni man̄olo, nji atwale empo yenu ku Jelusalema. <verse eid="1CO 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 16:4"/>Mi nji kame saku fanene nji ni mene nite, kame saate ni mene.<verse eid="1CO 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Emilelo ya Paulusi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 16:5"/>Kame sani mipotele munyima no kubita mu Masedoniya, kakuli kame ni nahana okubita endila no Masedoniya, <verse eid="1CO 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 16:6"/>Mwendi kame sa ni ikale naanyi simba okwikalamo omubebo onje, nji cwale muni tuse okuta mu mwendo wange okuta oko konje sanite. <verse eid="1CO 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 16:7"/>Kakuli kani singi okumimona bano mukubita fela, kame ni sepa okwikala naanyi enako icana nji Ombumu mbani lumelele.<verse eid="1CO 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 16:8"/>Kono kame sani ikale mu Efese okutwala ba Pentakota, <verse eid="1CO 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 16:9"/>kakuli kame nili ni kolo no kuwaba nji nitendemo omusebezi, kono cwale kame kuli aanu no kupula awo anilwisa.<verse eid="1CO 16:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 16:10"/>Cwale Timoteya aba sakeele, mu mutambule kanyi mwabenu, kakuli kame atenda omusebezi wa Mbumu kanyi meene omo nitendela. <verse eid="1CO 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 16:11"/>Cwale kulese okwikala omunu woyo so muyandisa. Mumulelubise mu mwendo waye mu kozo nji afanene okuuka kwa mene, kakuli kame nimutatelele okwiiya naasikupumena.<verse eid="1CO 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 16:12"/>Kanyi ku mwabetu Apolosi kame nisinga onene nji amipotele naasikupumena anjili, kono kasingi okwiiya abano, kame saiye aba sawane esibaka.<verse eid="1CO 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Amaywi no Mamaneneno</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 16:13"/>Mutone, mongole mu tumelo yenu, mu tende etindume ni koongola. <verse eid="1CO 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 16:14"/>Mu monise elilato mu inu yonje eyo mutenda.<verse eid="1CO 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 16:15"/>Abaange, cwale, kame mulimukile nji asindoo ya Setefanasi kame ana kutenda aa no weli okupumena mu Akiya, kame ana kuku beeka onyene ku musebezi no anu no kukena a Nyambe, <verse eid="1CO 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 16:16"/>kame ni mikumbela nji mukuteke aanu no ngeeso, ni kwa asikupumena onje nawo musebeza noo.<verse eid="1CO 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 16:17"/>Kame nina kuwabelelwa ba kwiiya kwa Setefanasi ni Fotanatasi ni Acaikasi kakuli kame ana kwikalako aba muna kuulwa okwikalako, <verse eid="1CO 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 16:18"/>kakuli kame anani katulusa wino emebo yange kanyi omo ana mikatulusete wino naanyi. Kame mufanena okukuteka aanu no ngeso.<verse eid="1CO 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 16:19"/>Etikeleke namu Asiya kame timi keeta, Akwila ni Pulisika bamweya ni keleke eyo ili mu ndoo yoo kame ami keeta onene mwa Mbumu. <verse eid="1CO 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 16:20"/>Abetu onje kame ami keeta. Mu kukeete mu ukutubeta no kukena. <verse eid="1CO 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 16:21"/>Mene Paulusi woyo on̄ola okukeeta oko ni Lyoko lyange. <verse eid="1CO 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 16:22"/>Nji omunjili kakwite elilato kwa Mbumu, mumulese akutiwe! Mbumu wetu wiiye! <verse eid="1CO 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 16:23"/>Esishemo sa Mbumu Jesu Kilesite siikale naanyi. <verse eid="1CO 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 16:24"/>Elilato lyange liikale naanyi monje mwa Jesu Kilesite Ameni.<verse eid="1CO 16:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 16"/>
</usx>
